
@clientUrl = http://localhost:8010
@baseUrl = {{clientUrl}}
@apiPrefix = /api/v1

# Port 8010 matches the VS Code debug configuration from project 01.
# If running via docker-compose with a different port (e.g. 8001), toggle:
# @clientUrl = http://localhost:8001

@applicationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

###
# 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health


###
# 2. Create Commercial Credit Application (Happy Path)
# @name createApplication
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company_name": "Apex Fintech Dynamics Inc.",
  "applicant_name": "JANE DOE",
  "requested_facility": 250000.00
}


###
# 3. Create Another Credit Application (Second Specimen)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company_name": "BlueStar Logistics LLC",
  "applicant_name": "ROBERT SMITH",
  "requested_facility": 500000.00
}


###
# 4. Submit Clean Dossier Manifest (4-Page Clean Specimen)
# You can use the dynamic ID from step 2 ({{createApplication.response.body.application_id}})
# or paste an ID into @applicationId above.
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/applications/{{createApplication.response.body.application_id}}/dossier
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "manifest": {
    "bank_statement": "tests/fixtures/clean_4pages/bank_statement_4pages.pdf",
    "kyc_id": "tests/fixtures/clean_4pages/kyc_executive_id.jpg",
    "tax_filing": "tests/fixtures/clean_4pages/tax_filing_irs1120.pdf"
  }
}


###
# 5. Submit Degraded Dossier Manifest (Page 2 OCR Noise)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/applications/{{createApplication.response.body.application_id}}/dossier
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "manifest": {
    "bank_statement": "tests/fixtures/degraded_page2/bank_statement_degraded.pdf",
    "kyc_id": "tests/fixtures/clean_4pages/kyc_executive_id.jpg",
    "tax_filing": "tests/fixtures/clean_4pages/tax_filing_irs1120.pdf"
  }
}


###
# 6. Submit Benchmark Dossier Manifest (16-Page High Load)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/applications/{{createApplication.response.body.application_id}}/dossier
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "manifest": {
    "bank_statement": "tests/fixtures/benchmark_16pages/bank_statement_16pages.pdf",
    "kyc_id": "tests/fixtures/clean_4pages/kyc_executive_id.jpg",
    "tax_filing": "tests/fixtures/clean_4pages/tax_filing_irs1120.pdf"
  }
}


###
# 7. Poll Application Status & Underwriting Memo
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/applications/{{createApplication.response.body.application_id}}


###
# 8. Retrieve Stage-by-Stage Latency Telemetry
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/applications/{{createApplication.response.body.application_id}}/timing


###
# 9. Negative Test: Validation Error on Application Creation (Negative Facility)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company_name": "Invalid Negative Corp",
  "applicant_name": "JOHN DOE",
  "requested_facility": -50000.00
}


###
# 10. Negative Test: Non-existent Application 404
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/applications/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000


###
# 11. Negative Test: Malformed UUID 404
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/applications/not-a-valid-uuid

